      "translation": {
        "english_text": "A coach arrives and stops. Baladevar, the queen and the others get down and go inside. Muthan, who drove the coach, also gets down. He takes the horse. A picture falls from it. Sukhadev notices.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "`அவன் குதிரையை எடுக்கிறான்` is kept conservatively as `He takes the horse`; no extra action such as tying or leading it away is added."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ammaiyappan-en-s001-u002",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
