      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Swami, what does `Ammaiyappan` mean.........",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The title-name `Ammaiyappan` is retained because the following exchange turns on its Tamil `Amma/Appa` wordplay."
        ]
